      "@context": "https://schema.org",
      "type": "{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What does the Outlook integration do?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"It lets your forms send emails — confirmations to respondents, alerts to your team, automated replies — from your own Outlook address instead of a generic system sender.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How do I connect Outlook?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Open Integrations from your dashboard, click Add integration under Outlook, sign in, and grant Formester permission to send emails. Then pick the account in your form's notification settings.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Is my password shared with Formester?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"No. The connection uses OAuth — you sign in directly with Outlook and can revoke access at any time from your account settings.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What if emails stop sending?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Reconnect the account from the Integrations page — that resolves most cases. If it continues, contact our support team.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is Formester?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Formester is an online form builder for creating forms, surveys, and quizzes with a drag-and-drop editor or AI. It connects with the tools your team already uses — Google Sheets, Slack, HubSpot, Zapier, and more — so your form data flows wherever you need it.\"}}]}"
    },
