      "title": [
        {
          "id": 5208,
          "text": "Outlook integration FAQs",
          "highlight": false,
          "color": "#475467",
          "bold": false
        }
      ],
      "faqList": [
        {
          "id": 2784,
          "header": "What does the Outlook integration do?",
          "body": "It lets your forms send emails — confirmations to respondents, alerts to your team, automated replies — from your own Outlook address instead of a generic system sender.",
          "body_markdown": "",
          "list": []
        },
        {
          "id": 2783,
          "header": "How do I connect Outlook?",
          "body": "Open Integrations from your dashboard, click Add integration under Outlook, sign in, and grant Formester permission to send emails. Then pick the account in your form's notification settings.",
          "body_markdown": "",
          "list": []
        },
        {
          "id": 2785,
          "header": "Is my password shared with Formester?",
          "body": "No. The connection uses OAuth — you sign in directly with Outlook and can revoke access at any time from your account settings.",
          "body_markdown": "",
          "list": []
        },
        {
          "id": 2786,
          "header": "What if emails stop sending?",
          "body": "Reconnect the account from the Integrations page — that resolves most cases. If it continues, contact our support team.",
          "body_markdown": "",
          "list": []
        },
        {
          "id": 2787,
          "header": "What is Formester?",
          "body": "Formester is an online form builder for creating forms, surveys, and quizzes with a drag-and-drop editor or AI. It connects with the tools your team already uses — Google Sheets, Slack, HubSpot, Zapier, and more — so your form data flows wherever you need it.",
          "body_markdown": "",
          "list": []
        }
      ]
    },
